        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Author of Plain Sight</strong></p><p>Maren ran a bike repair shop for nine years before she started helping other shop owners get found online. She has worked with bakeries, dentists, garages and one very busy locksmith.</p><p>Plain Sight is everything she shows them, in the order she shows it, so you can do it yourself in the evenings.</p><p><em>Sample photo and bio. Put your own here.</em></p>",
            "size_desktop": 16
          }
        }
      },
